<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Anjali Devi v. Shashi Kumar Pandey, First Appeal No. 218 of 2026 (2026:JHHC:32560-DB)</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Bench</th><td>Sujit Narayan Prasad and Akhil Kumar, JJ., High Court of Jharkhand</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Pronounced</th><td>5 November 2026 (reserved 29 September 2026)</td></tr>
